@baseUrl = http://localhost:5041

### Poprawne dane — HTTP 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/learning/orders/1
Accept: application/json

### Opcjonalne uwagi — HTTP 200, notes: null
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/learning/orders/2
Accept: application/json

### Brak danych — HTTP 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/learning/orders/999
Accept: application/json

### Niepoprawny identyfikator — HTTP 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/learning/orders/0
Accept: application/json

### Symulowana awaria źródła — HTTP 503
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/learning/orders/1?simulateFailure=true
Accept: application/json